{"id":"e382a4415fd419dc","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point.md","title":"闭项说谎者及其否定均不入极小固定点","display":"cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point — 闭项说谎者及其否定均不入极小固定点","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point","aliases":["91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point","91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal"],"display":"cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point — 闭项说谎者及其否定均不入极小固定点","depends_on":["[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point</span><span>91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point — 闭项说谎者及其否定均不入极小固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"80b21a90a0262f70\" href=\"?note=80b21a90a0262f70\" title=\"91-thm-liar-sentence-properties\">91-thm-liar-sentence-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 为直接闭项说谎者，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> 是从空集生成的一致固定点。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}in\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\quad\\land\\quad\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}in\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\quad\\land\\quad\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上游定理已对每个一致固定点证明同一否定方程的唯一三值解为未定义，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span> 代入即可。并非仅由任意 PA 可证双条件作语义替换。\n极小模型中的间隙不等于裸 KF 中四种句法不可证性，后者需要极小与过剩两个经典闭包模型分别反驳。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemmas 15.7、15.13–15.14 及上游说谎者定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-liar-sentence-properties","status":"resolved","id":"80b21a90a0262f70","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}liar\\text{-}not\\text{-}in\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\n\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}\\quad\\land\\quad\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\notin X_{\\min}.","display":true},{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false}],"bytes":1241,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-liar-not-in-minimal-fixed-point]]"}],"outgoing":["80b21a90a0262f70","460308c7099a8386"]}